#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of GStreamer Base Plug-ins"
msgstr "Instalação do GStreamer Base Plug-ins"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/gst10-plugins-base.xml:129
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>GStreamer Base Plug-ins</application> by running the "
"following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>GStreamer Base Plug-ins</application> executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/gst10-plugins-base.xml:133
#, no-wrap, xml-text
#| msgid ""
#| "<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
#| "cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
#| "\n"
#| "meson  setup ..               \\\n"
#| "       --prefix=/usr          \\\n"
#| "       --buildtype=release    \\\n"
#| "       --wrap-mode=nodownload \\\n"
#| "       -Dpackage-origin=https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/view/&blfs-version;/ \\\n"
#| "       -Dpackage-name=\"GStreamer &gst10-plugins-base-version; BLFS\"    &amp;&amp;\n"
#| "ninja</userinput>"
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..               \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr          \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release    \\\n"
"      --wrap-mode=nodownload &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..               \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr          \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release    \\\n"
"      --wrap-mode=nodownload &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/gst10-plugins-base.xml:143
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue: <command>ninja test</command>. The tests require"
" an X terminal running, or all of the GL tests will fail. Five tests may "
"produce timeouts on some systems depending on their graphics hardware and "
"speed. One test, <filename>elements_appsrc</filename>, is known to fail on "
"some systems."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>ninja test</command>. Os testes "
"exigem um terminal do X executando ou todos os testes GL falharão. Cinco "
"testes possivelmente produzam tempos limite em alguns sistemas, dependendo "
"do hardware gráfico deles e da velocidade. Um teste, "
"<filename>elements_appsrc</filename>, é conhecido por falhar em alguns "
"sistemas."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/gst10-plugins-base.xml:152
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"When installing, the build process does some additional linking.  If you do "
"not have Xorg in /usr, the LIBRARY_PATH variable needs to be defined for the"
" root user.  If using sudo to assume root, use the -E option to pass your "
"current environment variables for the install process."
msgstr ""
"Ao instalar, o processo de construção faz algumas vinculações adicionais. Se"
" você não tiver o Xorg em /usr, a variável LIBRARY_PATH precisa ser definida"
" para o(a) usuário(a) root. Se usar sudo para assumir o root, use a opção -E"
" para passar tuas variáveis de ambiente atuais para o processo de "
"instalação."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/gst10-plugins-base.xml:161
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/gst10-plugins-base.xml:164
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

